---
import { CLINIC_DATA } from "../lib/constants";
---

<footer
  class="bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 py-16 border-t border-slate-800 mt-auto"
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6">
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12 lg:gap-8 mb-16"
    >
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <a href="#" class="inline-block">
          <span
            class="font-['Outfit'] text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white"
          >
            Implantes Salud <span class="text-primary">Digital</span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          Clínica odontológica de vanguardia enfocada en resultados de por vida.
          Orgullosamente operando bajo estrictos estándares de calidad
          internacional.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center">
        <h4 class="text-white font-['Outfit'] font-bold text-lg mb-6">
          Contacto
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              class="w-5 h-5 text-primary shrink-0"
              ><path
                d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"
              ></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg
            >
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">Lerma 294, Salta</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              class="w-5 h-5 text-primary shrink-0"
              ><path
                d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"
              ></path></svg
            >
            <a
              href="tel:+5493874218096"
              class="text-sm text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors"
              >+54 93874218096</a
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              class="w-5 h-5 text-primary shrink-0"
              ><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path
                d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path></svg
            >
            <a
              href="mailto:comercial@implantessalud.com"
              class="text-sm text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors"
              >comercial@implantessalud.com</a
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center">
        <h4 class="text-white font-['Outfit'] font-bold text-lg mb-6">
          Síguenos
        </h4>
        <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
          <a
            href="https://instagram.com/implantessalud"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors group"
          >
            <div
              class="bg-primary/20 p-2 rounded-full group-hover:bg-primary transition-colors"
            >
              <svg
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                width="24"
                height="24"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                class="w-4 h-4"
                ><rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5"
                ></rect><path
                  d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"
                ></path><line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"
                ></line></svg
              >
            </div>
            <span class="text-sm">@implantessalud</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://www.facebook.com/implantessalud/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors group"
          >
            <div
              class="bg-primary/20 p-2 rounded-full group-hover:bg-primary transition-colors"
            >
              <svg
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                width="24"
                height="24"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                class="w-4 h-4"
                ><path
                  d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z"
                ></path></svg
              >
            </div>
            <span class="text-sm">Implantes Salud</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-900 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500"
    >
      <p>
        &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Implantes Salud Digital.
      </p>
      <a
        href={CLINIC_DATA.mapsUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="block mt-6 relative rounded-xl max-w-2/4 overflow-hidden group border border-slate-700 hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors w-full h-[150px]"
      >
        {/* Overlay para capturar el click y mostrar el botón */}
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 z-10 flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-900/30 group-hover:bg-slate-900/10 transition-colors"
        >
          <div
            class="bg-primary text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg"
          >
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              class="w-4 h-4"
              ><path
                d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"
              ></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg
            >
            Cómo llegar
          </div>
        </div>
        {
          /* iframe de Google Maps (pointer-events-none para que el click lo tome el overlay del anchor) */
        }
        <iframe
          src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Lerma%20294,%20Salta,%20Argentina&t=&z=15&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed"
          width="100%"
          height="150"
          style="border:0;"
          allowfullscreen=""
          loading="lazy"
          class="pointer-events-none opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity absolute inset-0 object-cover"
        ></iframe>
      </a>
      <span class="text-xs text-slate-400"
        >Desarrollado por <a
          href="https://cetzzlabs.com.ar"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-primary font-bold text-lg">Cetzz Labs</a
        ></span
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
